json" "file_sha256" "6cdf3b096f6c85db5dc278d862a4ca6c8b73e3a38dc02891eb5ec955ebfe6b82" "basis" 1196 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028479/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74412" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028479/state.json" "file_sha256" "6cdf3b096f6c85db5dc278d862a4ca6c8b73e3a38dc02891eb5ec955ebfe6b82" "basis" 1196 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028479/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74412" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028479/state.json" "file_sha256" "6cdf3b096f6c85db5dc278d862a4ca6c8b73e3a38dc02891eb5ec955ebfe6b82" "basis" 1196 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028479/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi }^{2\\pi }[6{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{4})-3+3cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})+x]\\,\\text{d}x=$  \n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/state.json" "file_sha256" "c9c104bfd85793ef3e6d6c2ccc5bf90e923f876ab7a0df3bc4c1c9aae75799f1" "basis" 1458 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${sin}^{2}$ term: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =1-2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta )={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{x}{4},$ we have\n\n$$\n6{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{4})=3(1-cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})).\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi }^{2\\pi }\\,\\,[6{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{4})-3+3cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})+x]dx & ={\\int }_{\\pi }^{2\\pi }\\,\\,[3-3cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})-3+3cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})+x]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi }^{2\\pi }x\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}|}_{\\pi }^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{(2\\pi )^{2}-{\\pi }^{2}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3{\\pi }^{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/state.json" "file_sha256" "c9c104bfd85793ef3e6d6c2ccc5bf90e923f876ab7a0df3bc4c1c9aae75799f1" "basis" 1458 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8952b286a033e30dac12d7f47bfda0bf8abe50ab1981d82fa9faa37531b2bbe4" "basis" 1458 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/state.json" "file_sha256" "c9c104bfd85793ef3e6d6c2ccc5bf90e923f876ab7a0df3bc4c1c9aae75799f1" "basis" 1458 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{3\\pi^2}{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/state.json" "file_sha256" "c9c104bfd85793ef3e6d6c2ccc5bf90e923f876ab7a0df3bc4c1c9aae75799f1" "basis" 1458 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040629/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-10457" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int (5{cos}^{2}⁡2x-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2})\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/state.json" "file_sha256" "9522df04f302bdb8dcde3cf81e98843781b55c167671f916b5ecdc1f60291a1f" "basis" 1649 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-10457" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta $ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x$, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡2x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5{cos}^{2}⁡2x-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2})\\text{d}x & =\\int [5\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1)-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{5}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+\\frac{5}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\frac{5}{2}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/state.json" "file_sha256" "9522df04f302bdb8dcde3cf81e98843781b55c167671f916b5ecdc1f60291a1f" "basis" 1649 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-10457" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8b2d097bc9bebb8d0c149fdb91ae88fc5bb4c8f339de3a2dc0a9341278d327f3" "basis" 1649 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-10457" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/state.json" "file_sha256" "9522df04f302bdb8dcde3cf81e98843781b55c167671f916b5ecdc1f60291a1f" "basis" 1649 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-10457" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{5}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x-\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/state.json" "file_sha256" "9522df04f302bdb8dcde3cf81e98843781b55c167671f916b5ecdc1f60291a1f" "basis" 1649 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/edb-import/verificati