on" "q-10559" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡x$ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=2{cos}^{2}⁡x-1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4{cos}^{2}⁡x-2)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4(\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+1))-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+2-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x)+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-10559" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "88c7e401f34dfd71b5bb0b70383af45dc65df5093ef61537bec281612c77ddad"} {"question" "q-10559" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-10559" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C"] ["math" "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-10559" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}({cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x={cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}({cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{4}{|}_{0}^{\\pi /24} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{24})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot 0)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(\\frac{1}{2}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "88c7e401f34dfd71b5bb0b70383af45dc65df5093ef61537bec281612c77ddad"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{8}"] ["math" "\\frac{2}{3}"] ["math" "\\frac{3}{8}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-51126" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{8}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-74412" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int (1-2{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2}))\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-74412" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${sin}^{2}$ term: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =1-2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{x}{2}$, we have\n\n$$\n1-2{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (1-2{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{2}))\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-74412" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "88c7e401f34dfd71b5bb0b70383af45dc65df5093ef61537bec281612c77ddad"} {"question" "q-74412" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-74412" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"] ["math" "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C"] ["math" "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-74412" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi }^{2\\pi }[6{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{4})-3+3cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})+x]\\,\\text{d}x=$  \n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${sin}^{2}$ term: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =1-2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta )={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{x}{4},$ we have\n\n$$\n6{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{4})=3(1-cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})).\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi }^{2\\pi }\\,\\,[6{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{4})-3+3cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})+x]dx & ={\\int }_{\\pi }^{2\\pi }\\,\\,[3-3cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})-3+3cos\\,(\\frac{x}{2})+x]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi }^{2\\pi }x\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}|}_{\\pi }^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{(2\\pi )^{2}-{\\pi }^{2}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3{\\pi }^{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "88c7e401f34dfd71b5bb0b70383af45dc65df5093ef61537bec281612c77ddad"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"} {"question" "q-348852" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{3\\pi^2}{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14049305/state.json" "file_sha256" "d0817e951b141646a4f28cb325def6482d14fd767972c9a8e51724c8c87bc959"}] "usage" {"q-10457" [] "q-10559" [] "q-74412" [] "q-348852" []} "basis" 1714 "retractions" [[17592186096853 :question/problem "Calculate\n\n$∫(4\\cos^{2} x - 2)dx$."]] "immutable_answers" [17592186093526 17592186093527 17592186093528 17592186093529 17592186093530 17592186292532 17592186292533 17592186292534 17592186292535 17592186292536 17592186309040 17592186322784 17592186322785 17592186322786 17592186322787 17592186322788] "immutable_fields" [[17592186093525 :answer-field/correct] [17592186093525 :answer-field/id] [17592186093525 :answer-field/key] [17592186093525 :answer-field/type] [17592186292531 :answer-field/correct] [17592186292531 :answer-field/id] [17592186292531 :answer-field/key] [17592186292531 :answer-field/type] [17592186309039 :answer-field/correct] [17592186309039 :answer-field/id] [17592186309039 :answer-field/key] [17592186309039 :answer-field/type] [17592186322783 :answer-field/correct] [17592186322783 :answer-field/id] [17592186322783 :answer-field/key] [17592186322783 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
